Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.76,0:01:19.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我從小個子就很高
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.03,0:01:22.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,朝會時總是排在最後面
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.40,0:01:25.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是我卻偏偏叫小泉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.81,0:01:28.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是抱歉 我不是叫大泉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.68,0:01:30.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是這麼奇怪了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.95,0:01:36.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以呢 國中部從明天起放暑假
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.21,0:01:40.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家一定要注意保重身體
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.20,0:01:46.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,特別是三年級生正處於升學準備階段
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.02,0:01:50.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望大家不要傷風感冒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.93,0:01:54.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一二年級生將會舉行…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.32,0:01:58.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完了！召喚獸都被滅了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.58,0:02:11.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是個笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.30,0:02:14.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,（高一的夏天！一定要交上男朋友！）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.09,0:02:15.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因為打遊戲熬夜了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.94,0:02:17.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.14,0:02:19.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是個假小子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.17,0:02:22.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,站著都能睡覺 你以為你是長頸鹿嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.35,0:02:23.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也許我的前世就是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.98,0:02:24.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挺有意思的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.90,0:02:25.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好！既然這麼有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.03,0:02:27.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,作為處罰明天開始你也要來學校
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.25,0:02:29.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是吧 明天開始是暑假欸
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.10,0:02:30.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你沒暑假了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.07,0:02:33.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你必須參加暑期輔導
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.07,0:02:35.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欸~
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.30,0:02:36.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反對無效 好了 回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.08,0:02:41.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,個子高真是沒什麼好事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.34,0:02:43.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管做什麼都很引人注目
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.30,0:02:50.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,來 給你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.70,0:02:51.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在刺激我嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.66,0:02:54.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 聽說你在籃球部很努力
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.16,0:02:55.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真了不起啊 小谷先生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.87,0:02:57.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是大谷！呆子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.27,0:02:59.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走開 女巨人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.19,0:03:00.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老師 我拿來了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.76,0:03:01.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦 辛苦你了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.81,0:03:03.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我對你那麼親切 你還叫我女巨人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.59,0:03:06.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叫你巨神兵也可以
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.48,0:03:07.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吵死了！矮冬瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.55,0:03:08.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你說什麼 找死啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.63,0:03:09.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,來試試看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.44,0:03:10.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an9}（註："ALL阪神·巨人"是日本有名的多口相聲搞笑二人組）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.63,0:03:10.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 那邊的“ALL阪神·巨人”
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.76,0:03:11.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叫誰啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.61,0:03:14.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要那樣叫我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.77,0:03:17.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,“ALL 阪神·巨人”
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.37,0:03:21.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是中野老師在入學當天給我們取的外號
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.56,0:03:24.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有誰願意做班級委員的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.81,0:03:27.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 那邊的“ALL 阪神·巨人”
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.09,0:03:30.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就由小泉和大谷來擔當吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.33,0:03:33.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.98,0:03:34.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.07,0:03:35.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼呀真是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.33,0:03:37.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幹什麼啊 讓我出去
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.27,0:03:37.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,讓開 女巨人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.15,0:03:39.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你才是 矮冬瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.77,0:03:41.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了好了 打情罵俏到此為止
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.97,0:03:42.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才不是打情罵俏
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.40,0:03:49.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,暑期輔導可真累人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.79,0:03:52.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小信期中考不及格 沒辦法呀
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.13,0:03:57.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我親愛的要來學校參加籃球部練習 正好一起
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.29,0:03:59.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,中尾啊 真好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.19,0:04:02.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要是有個男朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.09,0:04:04.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不對 至少有個喜歡的人的話
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.07,0:04:06.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也能有點幹勁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.04,0:04:11.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,話說回來 我最好奇的是田春居然也來參加自習
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.47,0:04:14.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真不愧是年級第一名 深謀遠慮啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.00,0:04:19.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是我不希望離開好朋友嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.26,0:04:21.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,開玩笑的 我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.78,0:04:25.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 暑期輔導是跟別的班一起上的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.16,0:04:27.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能不能碰上個好男人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.06,0:04:31.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只要不碰到大谷那個矮冬瓜就是身處天堂了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.05,0:04:33.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不喜歡男人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.05,0:04:37.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎麼會在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.19,0:04:39.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我還想問你咧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.78,0:04:44.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對了 我怎麼忘了大谷是個大笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.05,0:04:45.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有資格說別人嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.17,0:04:48.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是在會上打呼才被叫來上課的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.87,0:04:49.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這有什麼好驕傲的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.98,0:04:51.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比考不及格的人好多了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.46,0:04:52.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打呼的人才差勁吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.27,0:04:56.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 “ALL阪神·巨人”暑期也在說相聲啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.67,0:04:58.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都說了不要那樣叫我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.49,0:05:00.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小信 我要換座位
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.21,0:05:02.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小信
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.39,0:05:03.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,親愛的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.97,0:05:04.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 這麼回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.76,0:05:07.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坐男生的旁邊啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.40,0:05:09.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是 太勉強了吧 我明白
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.63,0:05:15.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,厄…厄運啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.21,0:05:18.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是個災難的暑假
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.97,0:05:21.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能不能碰上個好男人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.00,0:05:25.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對不起 我遲到了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.90,0:05:26.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 鈴木啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.26,0:05:29.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我還沒點名 不算你遲到
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.54,0:05:30.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先從1班開始
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.74,0:05:31.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿部
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.51,0:05:31.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.14,0:05:32.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飯田
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.83,0:05:33.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.35,0:05:33.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上野
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.02,0:05:34.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.50,0:05:34.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,遠藤
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.22,0:05:35.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.90,0:05:36.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大町
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.45,0:05:36.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.00,0:05:44.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 我能坐在你後面嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.63,0:05:47.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 好 請坐
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.18,0:05:50.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坐在小泉後面會看不到黑板的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.89,0:05:51.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真囉嗦 大谷
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.14,0:05:54.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對不起啊 我長得太高了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.14,0:05:59.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒關係 反正我看得見
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.81,0:06:10.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喜歡他 也許這是個最棒的暑假
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.19,0:06:27.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理莎她怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.65,0:06:28.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道耶
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.30,0:06:29.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂喂 這位大姐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.39,0:06:33.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有事找你 一塊回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.21,0:06:35.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不良小鬼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.60,0:06:36.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吵死了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.51,0:06:38.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,為什麼放學後還要跟你一起啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.30,0:06:41.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因為有些重要的的話不方便在學校裡講
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.00,0:06:43.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底想說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.60,0:06:47.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你 喜歡鈴木這一型吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.88,0:06:50.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你你你怎麼知道
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.31,0:06:53.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一看就知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.14,0:06:55.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼會被看穿了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.03,0:06:57.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因為就寫在你臉上呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.46,0:06:59.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an9}（對鈴木一見鍾情）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.39,0:06:59.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想威脅我要錢嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.96,0:07:03.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼可能 我人最好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.84,0:07:06.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我剛好想和鈴木同學交個朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.22,0:07:09.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,說不定能幫到你喔
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.84,0:07:10.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咦？真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.17,0:07:11.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Yes I do
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.28,0:07:13.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.01,0:07:13.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的 真的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.76,0:07:14.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好厲害！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.72,0:07:17.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原來大谷是個善良的傢伙呀
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.25,0:07:19.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你現在才發現啊 笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.50,0:07:24.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是 在前世一定是長頸鹿和獵人的關係
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.47,0:07:24.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼麒麟？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.25,0:07:26.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了 這個暫且放一邊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.56,0:07:29.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 今天姐姐我請客
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.08,0:07:32.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要吃大漢堡？魚堡？還是超值套餐？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.25,0:07:33.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,超值套餐
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.06,0:07:34.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,包在我身上
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.89,0:07:35.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還有
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.23,0:07:36.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還有？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.23,0:07:39.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還有…田中同學
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.43,0:07:40.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.01,0:07:41.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,田中千春！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.27,0:07:44.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欸！？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.00,0:07:48.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我沒想到你會喜歡千春那型啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.86,0:07:50.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋 她超可愛的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.84,0:07:53.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 同為女孩子的我也覺得千春很可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.83,0:07:56.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,難道說小個子就是喜歡小個子型的？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.57,0:07:57.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要你管
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.25,0:08:00.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事實上有個不好的消息要告訴你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.54,0:08:01.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.68,0:08:03.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,千春 討厭男孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.21,0:08:04.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.99,0:08:05.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,消息可靠
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.78,0:08:08.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好可愛！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.05,0:08:10.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,討厭男孩子算什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.56,0:08:11.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我會治好她的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.41,0:08:13.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我會好好期待的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.13,0:08:15.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了 現在我充滿了動力
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.87,0:08:17.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你好好努力
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.75,0:08:21.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,客人 店內禁止拳擊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.22,0:08:23.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,游泳？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.58,0:08:26.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 跟我們一起去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.40,0:08:28.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真期待呀
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.84,0:08:29.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還有
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.22,0:08:33.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還有我的一些朋友也會來
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.73,0:08:35.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鈴木同學
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.06,0:08:38.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能和你交個朋友嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.61,0:08:46.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哇 游泳了~
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.10,0:08:48.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不就是游泳嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.44,0:08:49.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有那麼開心嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.80,0:08:50.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常開心
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.58,0:08:53.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一年沒來游泳了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.20,0:08:53.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是 我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.44,0:09:00.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.35,0:09:03.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哇 好棒
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.44,0:09:05.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然跟學校的泳池不一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.51,0:09:10.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋 現在不是玩樂的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.75,0:09:11.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不也玩得很開心
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.21,0:09:15.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟了 高興到忘記正經事了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.93,0:09:17.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鈴木同學
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.30,0:09:19.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 去那邊游泳嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.10,0:09:20.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.31,0:09:23.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好像不太想來是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.67,0:09:25.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不想來 我就不會來了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.37,0:09:25.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.12,0:09:27.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看著你們讓我覺得很有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.09,0:09:28.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有趣？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.61,0:09:32.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鈴木同學是因為考試不及格才來參加暑期輔導的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.43,0:09:36.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是 因為考試那天我感冒請假
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.48,0:09:37.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喔 是這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.39,0:09:38.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.18,0:09:45.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要說點什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.61,0:09:47.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快點 快點 繼續找話題啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.79,0:09:50.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我不知道該說什麼啦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.84,0:09:52.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.94,0:09:53.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉同學
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.86,0:09:54.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玩得開心嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.08,0:09:56.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我們四個人一起玩沙灘排球吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.75,0:10:02.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底在幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.61,0:10:04.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,兩個人呆呆地漂在水面上好玩嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.90,0:10:07.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是我不知道該說什麼嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.37,0:10:09.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是最會裝老實的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.64,0:10:10.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.49,0:10:11.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就這樣就這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.81,0:10:14.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和你平常一樣就好了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.16,0:10:15.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自然一點
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.60,0:10:20.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很痛的欸
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.06,0:10:21.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 來玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.98,0:10:22.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快來
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.41,0:10:34.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.90,0:10:35.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼了？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.02,0:10:38.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對了 中尾和小信去哪了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.41,0:10:40.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.61,0:10:42.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他們剛剛去玩那個了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.76,0:10:44.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,滑水道
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.96,0:10:49.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,滑水…道
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.80,0:10:57.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哇…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.31,0:10:59.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鈴木同學 要不要一起去\N田中同學 要不要一起去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.29,0:11:01.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我怕玩那個
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.15,0:11:03.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也怕
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.53,0:11:04.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這樣…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.67,0:11:14.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我們能不能去玩一會會兒
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.12,0:11:15.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.89,0:11:16.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.02,0:11:17.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呀 滑水道
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.08,0:11:18.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我來啦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.72,0:11:19.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也來了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.50,0:11:20.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,來了來了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.29,0:11:20.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太幸運了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.53,0:11:23.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要在游泳池邊跑步
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.56,0:11:34.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回來啦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.35,0:11:35.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好玩嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.72,0:11:37.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,超好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.20,0:11:41.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又異口同聲了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.84,0:11:42.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咦？鈴木同學呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.49,0:11:45.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道啊 他剛才就不在了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.89,0:11:46.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鈴木同學啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.08,0:11:50.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我來找你們時 他一個人不知道去哪了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.17,0:11:55.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丟下我一個人去玩 我可不做
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.69,0:11:59.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.63,0:12:01.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鈴木同學
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.47,0:12:02.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去哪了呀
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.77,0:12:04.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我口渴 去買果汁了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.97,0:12:06.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也給大家買了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.79,0:12:08.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是雪中送炭啊 鈴木同學
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.39,0:12:09.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這個可以嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.36,0:12:09.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.10,0:12:12.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,田中同學的我買了熱的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.03,0:12:13.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.83,0:12:16.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感覺你身體發冷
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.68,0:12:18.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.91,0:12:20.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好冰
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.93,0:12:23.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對不起 要不要給你換熱飲？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.68,0:12:24.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要緊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.67,0:12:26.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那個你玩了好幾次了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.20,0:12:28.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很棒 非常好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.43,0:12:29.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不害怕嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.19,0:12:31.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一點都不害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.98,0:12:32.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.84,0:12:33.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那待會我也去玩
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.16,0:12:34.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哇 去吧去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.35,0:12:38.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像平常一樣聊天 感覺真不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.52,0:12:40.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又曬黑了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.72,0:12:42.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很厲害吧 馬上就黑了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.95,0:12:47.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竟然真能治好千春的男性恐懼症
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.17,0:12:49.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那傢伙還蠻厲害的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.38,0:12:52.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再見
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.37,0:12:53.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明天見
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.35,0:12:55.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再見
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.60,0:12:57.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要緊吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.72,0:12:58.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.78,0:13:01.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,千春和鈴木同方向啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.11,0:13:05.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用擔心 鈴木人不錯的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.44,0:13:07.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,千春的男性恐懼症也被我治好了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.55,0:13:09.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,現在跟我感情好著呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.76,0:13:12.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 你們在一起的感覺好好喔
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.61,0:13:13.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉也不錯啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.55,0:13:20.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,謝謝 託大谷的福
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.86,0:13:23.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 明天開始也要加油啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.43,0:13:25.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 讓我們一起抓住幸福吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.04,0:13:31.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是 是怎麼回事呢 這種不好的預感
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.19,0:13:37.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鈴木同學 人真不錯喔
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.99,0:13:41.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,難道你喜歡他
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.46,0:13:43.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是不是啦 我不是這個意思
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.44,0:13:45.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喲 挺機靈的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.11,0:13:49.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他昨天還送我回家
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.43,0:13:51.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,送你回家？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.83,0:13:55.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我本以為男孩子都很粗魯恐怖的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.52,0:13:56.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是鈴木同學很溫柔
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.08,0:13:58.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我並不怕他
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.37,0:14:00.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是…是嗎…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.51,0:14:03.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是你昨天不是和大谷聊得很開心嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.66,0:14:07.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小信說得好 大谷呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.36,0:14:09.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對哦 大谷？我和他很聊得來呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.68,0:14:10.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對吧對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.61,0:14:13.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大概因為他個子小 不覺得他是男生吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.00,0:14:15.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,發射！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.82,0:14:24.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷 徹底失敗…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.58,0:14:29.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,悲慘 要是大谷聽到的話 會怎樣呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.47,0:14:33.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.60,0:14:34.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早 大谷
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.66,0:14:35.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.73,0:14:36.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早 大谷同學
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.46,0:14:39.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早安 田中同學
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.98,0:14:41.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨天玩得很開心
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.77,0:14:45.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷你真是個有趣的人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.27,0:14:46.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.07,0:14:50.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是大谷 我這麼矮 應該是小谷
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.92,0:14:52.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,振作點 大谷
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.28,0:14:52.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是小谷
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.09,0:14:56.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,請幫我告訴老師小谷今天要請假
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.99,0:14:59.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小…小谷！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.98,0:15:00.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是大谷
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.59,0:15:06.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.98,0:15:09.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你都叫我小谷了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.89,0:15:15.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呃…我…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.02,0:15:17.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼 你要安慰我嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.92,0:15:20.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼嘛 我在擔心你耶
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.87,0:15:21.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你鬧什麼彆扭啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.13,0:15:22.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鬧彆扭又怎樣
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.62,0:15:25.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,別人說你個子小又怎樣
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.44,0:15:26.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是男生欸
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.90,0:15:29.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是就因為個子小 別人不當我是男生
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.75,0:15:33.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.09,0:15:35.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,個子高也好 個子小也好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.55,0:15:36.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要有OX就是男的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.55,0:15:36.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}為了建設和諧社會需要特此隱去2字
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.39,0:15:38.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女孩子別把那個說出來啦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.87,0:15:39.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,閉嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.39,0:15:42.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到現在你已經被多少人說了個子小
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.46,0:15:44.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只不過被女孩子說一次有什麼丟臉的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.11,0:15:47.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這點小事就感到沮喪 你有什麼資格喜歡別人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.22,0:15:48.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,垃圾
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.94,0:15:51.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 氣死我了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.73,0:15:57.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你這一重拳還真打醒了我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.36,0:16:02.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.12,0:16:03.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鈴木同學
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.20,0:16:04.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.43,0:16:08.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早 現在已經是上課時間了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.40,0:16:10.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 我遲到了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.17,0:16:12.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,夏天的早上總是爬不起來
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.88,0:16:13.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.86,0:16:17.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冬天的早上也爬不起來
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.52,0:16:18.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.14,0:16:21.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨天約我 謝謝你們 很好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.48,0:16:23.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 嗯 別客氣
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.97,0:16:25.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.83,0:16:26.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.68,0:16:27.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我長得很恐怖嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.35,0:16:28.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.73,0:16:32.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨天田中同學好像很怕我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.01,0:16:36.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鈴木同學是個不錯的人哦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.29,0:16:40.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那孩子本來就很害怕男孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.31,0:16:41.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以不是鈴木同學的錯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.61,0:16:45.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不太習慣和女生說話
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.78,0:16:46.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.29,0:16:51.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 不過 和小泉同學很聊得來
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.89,0:16:57.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大概是因為你和我差不多高
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.81,0:17:01.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒覺得你是女孩子吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.92,0:17:03.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.80,0:17:04.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,徹底失敗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.24,0:17:10.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原來如此
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.36,0:17:11.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.39,0:17:15.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原來田中同學並不是特別討厭我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.77,0:17:23.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你該不會是喜歡千春吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.82,0:17:25.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是不是 你在說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.54,0:17:26.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是你的臉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.28,0:17:27.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是 熱 是因為太熱了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.71,0:17:29.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我先走了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.30,0:17:32.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.53,0:17:37.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這是怎麼回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.16,0:17:40.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他一定是喜歡她啦 太明顯了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.49,0:17:42.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 大泉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.40,0:17:45.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,剛剛還在教訓人的你怎麼變得這麼沮喪
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.04,0:17:49.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對不起 當我剛剛什麼都沒說過
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.61,0:17:50.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這算什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.65,0:17:52.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還是覺得很難過
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.43,0:17:54.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,平常我不會太在意的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.24,0:17:56.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是沒想到被喜歡的人這麼說 心好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.52,0:17:58.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.44,0:18:00.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,會痛的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.40,0:18:01.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這是剛剛的回禮
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.57,0:18:02.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可是女人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.66,0:18:03.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,\N我是不會放棄千春的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.76,0:18:05.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明天我會繼續加油
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.56,0:18:07.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.45,0:18:08.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這點小事就感到沮喪
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.41,0:18:09.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還有什麼資格喜歡人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.47,0:18:11.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這是我爺爺的遺言
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.04,0:18:12.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,騙人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.58,0:18:15.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉能在我身邊真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.75,0:18:18.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是只有我一個人 一定會在那裡自怨自艾
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.93,0:18:21.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,說得也是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.65,0:18:23.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也會加油的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.43,0:18:27.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.47,0:18:28.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加油吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.03,0:18:30.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,夏日祭典到了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.89,0:18:34.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我邀請了鈴木同學 大谷和千春
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.57,0:18:41.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼穿浴衣增添女人味戰略
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.35,0:18:43.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根本就不適合高個子的我嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.19,0:18:48.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷 千春他們還沒來啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.02,0:18:53.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,電車也這麼擁擠 他們該不會迷路了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.81,0:18:56.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.47,0:18:57.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以為是誰呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.63,0:18:59.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很奇怪嗎？ 我穿這樣很奇怪吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.70,0:19:01.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒有 你很有精神啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.76,0:19:03.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,當然了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.14,0:19:05.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對不起 我遲到了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.38,0:19:06.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,來了來了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.50,0:19:09.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理莎 鈴木同學也一起來了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.78,0:19:11.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我們半路遇到的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.68,0:19:22.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和風吹拂
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.03,0:19:24.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,為了不讓別人撞到她 他才換到人多的一邊吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.97,0:19:25.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真搞不明白
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.94,0:19:27.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,雖然搞不明白 但他真是不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.71,0:19:32.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感覺好速配啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.82,0:19:35.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像剛交往的情侶
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.51,0:19:40.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.72,0:19:41.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.35,0:19:44.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就這樣吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.05,0:19:46.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我死心了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.95,0:19:53.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也死心了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.30,0:19:54.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.04,0:19:56.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,說相聲要知道該何時退場
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.01,0:20:00.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就讓他們兩個人走下去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.59,0:20:03.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.17,0:20:05.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咦？理莎？大谷同學？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.64,0:20:08.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀 又破了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.29,0:20:08.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 做得不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.24,0:20:10.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看我的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.39,0:20:11.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好棒 NICE
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.36,0:20:20.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 大谷 這次…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.28,0:20:23.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咦？大谷 大谷
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.60,0:20:24.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.92,0:20:25.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嚇了我一跳
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.29,0:20:28.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你個子小 還以為被人群淹沒了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.49,0:20:29.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想吵架嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.65,0:20:30.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.62,0:20:32.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你這是什麼態度 感覺怪怪的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.84,0:20:35.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吃烏賊去 烤烏賊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.08,0:20:41.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷雖然個子小
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.58,0:20:43.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過他的手的確是男生的手
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.74,0:20:47.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,雖然總是吵架
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.12,0:20:50.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我們卻有很多相同之處
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.51,0:20:54.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因為我們都為身高感到自卑
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.32,0:21:00.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喜歡你 請和我交往吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.26,0:21:01.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.86,0:21:07.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不久之後 千春和鈴木同學順利交往了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.12,0:21:10.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,終於鬆了口氣
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.80,0:21:11.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.15,0:21:15.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你和千春的進展真不順利啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.74,0:21:18.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉和鈴木同學不也沒有成功
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.34,0:21:19.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.55,0:21:20.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過 沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.56,0:21:23.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保持著這份心情 我很快就會交到女朋友的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.36,0:21:25.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是嘛？拭目以待吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.79,0:21:30.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,讓我們決一勝負吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.63,0:21:33.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看誰先交到男朋友/N看誰先交到女朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.74,0:21:35.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我贏了要怎樣？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.38,0:21:37.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喜歡的遊戲請到你玩膩為止
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.51,0:21:40.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果是我贏的話 你得給我買雙新的籃球鞋
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.63,0:21:43.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就這麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.45,0:21:45.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不會輸的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.81,0:23:28.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欸 之前的女朋友？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.68,0:23:30.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是因為大谷的錯
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.26,0:23:30.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.69,0:23:34.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戀愛情結 love·com 次回
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.96,0:23:36.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和過去女友的三角關係！？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.93,0:23:37.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,記得看哦
